From 78fd959c5f20af5f58b1764348886ef10bd1fd49 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefan <kloterstefan@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 07:43:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 21/22] Vizzbox 1.1: the voice budget with the user's sounds
 and playing along (BRIEF-VIZZBOX-1.1.md 7)

A sound the user chose (or its release, ENV SYNC, voice mode turned) is planned with its own tail, estimated from its
envelopes (producer.c vb_tail_ms, vb_ring_ms): the amplitude envelope's release to the end of a voice, ENV SYNC's note
value, FM6's carriers (its own envelopes end its voices), DRUM-X a lane's DECAY (the louder end of MORPH, its DECAY
knob), DRUM's presets from a small measured table (VB_DRING) moved by its DECAY knobs; every factory sound measured
against it. A POLY sound (or one of hits) on a role the producer plays with one voice counts a voice a note (vb_ply,
at most its engine's voices), as the chords do. Playing along: the white keys held and still ringing on the focus
track (a sound of one voice: none; DRUMS a lane a key; CHORDS three or four a key, at most six) leave the bar after
next that much room (vb_room). The engines' costs in the budget (the brief's way when the heaviest choice does not fit
otherwise): a voice of a sound the user chose counts its engine's dearest factory voice measured, in quarter voices
(VB_EW: PHYS two, GRAIN 1 3/4, FM6 and DRUM-X 1 1/2, the others one); with a bass sound of the user's ringing on, the
budget may take its notes too. Without a hand on them the songs of 1.0 bit for bit (the golden).

tests/producer_test.c tails (every factory sound, the kits each lane, the DECAY knobs moved: never longer than
estimated), budget_user (the longest tails on every role and random factory sounds over three drops: at most 8 voices,
none stolen from the DROP on; two keys on a POLY LEAD, a one-finger chord on CHORDS: none stolen from the fourth bar
on; DRUM-X DEEP KIT and PHYS BOWED METAL everywhere: never more than the budget in quarter voices);
tests/vizzbox_budget.c: the heaviest choice (each factory sound's CPU a voice, less the device without its notes, for
its place in the budget: the dearest on every track, in the heaviest drop, every effect) against Skiff's heavy song;
tests/vizzbox_mutants.py five faults more.

