+/* (1.1, BRIEF-VIZZBOX-1.1.md 7) playing along: the voices the white keys take on the focus track, held and still
+ * ringing (a key let go within its sound's tail: vb_tail_ms) (none for a sound of one voice: the role's own; DRUMS a
